  "design": {
    "idea": "Quarter-turn the Kneecap Rotor Gear so its mounted Blue Transformer redirects the north furnace beam through the iron window to quench a molten slag block into solid basalt; push the cooled slag onto the east bumper plate so the giant's Right Step catches the sliding crate dead-center on the adjacent plate, opening the Shoulder Key Vault and Knee Lift!",
    "kind": "puzzle",
    "beat": "sho",
    "teaches": "rotor + blue_transformer + beam_emitter cooling molten slag into a planted tilt bumper",
    "decisions": 8,
    "expert_s": 55,
    "reward": "col_key_1+open_r5",
    "why": "Signature clockwork-meets-stride puzzle showing cooled basalt resists tilting while crates slide against it.",
